        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2011, Nobe Modern Toilet Tissue Holder With Cover</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Single Post Nobe Toilet Paper Holder With Cover is made with the quality that Deltana is known for. It is available in polished chrome and satin nickel finishes. The contemporary mount ensures that it would look sleek in any modern decor while the cover keeps the roll in place.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2011-specifications.gif?v=1704354723\" width=\"600\" height=\"270\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2011 Nobe Toilet Tissue Holder With Cover Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana Nobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Nobe Toilet Paper Roll Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cover Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cover Height: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible to hang in either direction.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2011.pdf?v=1691095350\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2011 Nobe Toilet Tissue Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
